<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, lead me to some soul in sin,</l><l>And grant that I may be</l><l>Endued with power and love to win</l><l>That soul, dear Lord, for Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>To win that soul for Thee, my Lord,</l><l>Will be my constant prayer;</l><l>That when I’ve won Thy full reward</l><l>I’ll with that dear one share.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
